| Feature | Implementation |
| :--- | :--- |
| **SQL Injection Prevention** | PDO Prepared Statements (`:username` placeholder). |
| **Password Security** | `password_verify()` (assumes registration used `password_hash()`). |
| **Session Fixation** | `session_regenerate_id(true)` on successful login. |
| **Session Hijacking** | `cookie_httponly`, `cookie_secure`, `use_strict_mode` in `session_start()`. |
| **CSRF Protection** | Synchronizer token pattern (`csrf_token` in session + hidden form field). |
