| Feature | Implementation |
| :--- | :--- |
| **HttpOnly / Secure / SameSite** | `COOKIE_OPTIONS` prevents XSS/CSRF. |
| **Selector/Validator Split** | `selector` (public) finds row; `validator` (secret) proves ownership. DB stores **hash** of validator. |
| **Timing Safe Comparison** | `crypto.timingSafeEqual` prevents timing attacks on validator verification. |
| **Token Rotation** | `rotateToken` issues fresh token on every authenticated request (sliding 30-day window) and invalidates the old one. Mitigates token theft impact. |
| **Automatic Cleanup** | Expired/Invalid tokens deleted on detection. |
| **Fail Closed** | Any DB error or malformed cookie results in `next()` (anonymous) + cookie cleared. |

