### Key Security Details Implemented

| Feature | Implementation |
| :--- | :--- |
| **HttpOnly** | `true` (JavaScript cannot access cookie -> mitigates XSS theft) |
| **Secure** | `true` in production (HTTPS only) |
| **SameSite: 'lax'** | Default CSRF protection for modern browsers |
| **Selector/Validator** | DB stores only `hash(validator)`. Cookie holds `selector:validator`. DB leak != Account takeover. |
| **Token Rotation** | `deleteRememberToken` + `issueRememberMe` on every auto-login. Stolen cookie becomes useless after legitimate user returns. |
| **Timing Safe Compare** | `crypto.timingSafeEqual` prevents timing attacks on hash verification. |
| **Entropy** | 256-bit Validator (`crypto.randomBytes(32)`) makes brute-force impossible. |
| **Expiry** | 30 Days (`maxAge`) enforced in Cookie **AND** Database (`expiresAt`). |

