### 4. Missing Piece: Session -> User Loader
The `rememberMeMiddleware` handles the cookie. You still need a middleware to load `req.user` from `req.session.userId` (standard login).

Add this **before** `rememberMeMiddleware` or **after** (order matters for precedence):

```javascript
// middleware/sessionUserLoader.js
async function sessionUserLoader(req, res, next) {
  if (req.session?.userId && !req.user) { // Don't override if remember-me already set (unlikely here)
    try {
      const user = await db.getUserById(req.session.userId);
      if (user) req.user = user;
      else req.session.destroy(); // User deleted
    } catch (e) { console.error(e); }
  }
  next();
}
module.exports = sessionUserLoader;
