### Security Checklist for this Implementation
| Feature | Implemented? | Details |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Plaintext Storage** | ✅ **No** | Only SHA-256(secret + pepper) stored in `BYTEA` column. |
| **Pepper/Secret** | ✅ Yes | `API_KEY_PEPPER` env var adds server-side secret to hash. |
| **Timing Attacks** | ✅ Yes | `crypto.timingSafeEqual` used for hash comparison. |
| **Entropy** | ✅ Yes | 256 bits (32 bytes) via `crypto.randomBytes`. |
| **Prefix Leakage** | ⚠️ Partial | All keys share prefix `sk_live_`. Validation scans all active keys for that prefix. For **high scale (>100k keys)**, embed a Key ID in the prefix (e.g., `sk_live_<keyid>_<secret>`) to allow `WHERE id = $1` lookup. |
| **Revocation** | ✅ Yes | Soft delete via `revoked_at` timestamp. |
| **Expiration** | ✅ Yes | `expires_at` column checked in validation query. |
| **Audit Trail** | ✅ Yes | `last_used_at` updated on successful validation. |

