| **Error Handling** | Global error handler distinguishes between `MulterError` (size/field issues) and custom `fileFilter` errors (wrong type), returning clean JSON 400 responses. |
| **Directory Safety** | `fs.mkdirSync(..., { recursive: true })` ensures `./uploads` exists on startup. |

