### Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Solution |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Security** | **No `pickle`**. Uses JSON + explicit type tagging (`__type`, `data`). Prevents Remote Code Execution (RCE) via cookie tampering. |
| **Cookie Safety** | **Base64 URL-safe (`urlsafe_b64encode`)**. Removes `+`, `/`, `=` padding. Safe for `Set-Cookie` headers without extra quoting. |
| **Size Limit (4KB)** | `json.dumps(..., separators=(',', ':'))` removes whitespace. Base64 adds ~33% overhead. Keep object flat/small. |
| **Dates/TZ** | ISO 8601 (`isoformat` / `fromisoformat`). Preserves timezone awareness (`datetime.timezone.utc`). |
| **Dataclasses** | Generic `_encode_dataclass` uses `dataclasses.fields` + `get_type_hints`. Recursive `encode`/`decode` handles arbitrary nesting. |
| **Extensibility** | `SettingsCodec` class isolates logic. Add `UUID`, `Decimal`, `Enum`, or other dataclasses by updating `_type_to_tag` and `_custom_encoders/decoders`. |
| **Error Handling** | `load_user_settings` fails **closed** (returns `None`) on any decode error (corruption, tampering, version skew). |

### How to extend for a new Dataclass (e.g., `UserProfile`)

```python
