class UserProfile:
    user_id: int
    display_name: str
    roles: List[str]
    __type_tag__ = "UserProfile" # Convention

# In SettingsCodec.__init__:
self._type_to_tag[UserProfile] = UserProfile.__type_tag__
self._tag_to_type[UserProfile.__type_tag__] = UserProfile
# Reuses generic _encode_dataclass automatically, but add specific decoder if needed:
self._custom_decoders[UserProfile.__type_tag__] = lambda d: UserProfile(**{k: _codec.decode(v) for k,v in d.items()})
```

